## Why This Is Asked
Assesses end-to-end OTCA thinking: data model, on-ingest privacy, per-tenant residency, and a simple QoS rule at the edge.

## Key Concepts
- OTCA governance and per-tenant residency
- Ingest-time privacy: redaction and per-tenant hashing
- Latency-variance based event filtering
- Streaming path: Client -> Edge -> Regional Kafka -> Parquet on S3 with tenant/date partitions
- Test strategy: privacy, QoS, retention, and cross-region consistency

## Code Example
```javascript
function rollingMedian(nums) {
  if (!nums.length) return 0;
  const s = nums.slice().sort((a,b)=>a-b);
  const m = Math.floor(s.length/2);
  return s.length%2 ? s[m] : (s[m-1]+s[m])/2;
}
```

